===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[cross]]-[[link]]}}

# {{lb|en|chemistry}} To join [[polymer]] chains together to form one single molecule. An object made from a crosslinked material contains only one supergiant molecule. Crosslinking may take place through covalent bonds or ionic bonds
# {{lb|en|computing}} To [[bolster up]] the references of [[database]]s or elements in a [[database]] to each other, to [[deorphan]] ''[[sensu lato]]''

